1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,259
Submit the week, review the hours, then
export only what is approved.

2
00:00:05,233 --> 00:00:08,258
Open Timesheets from Time entries and choose
the week.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,885
Finish timers and sync pending entries
before submitting.

4
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:15,627
Select the team member and review the
entries.

5
00:00:15,867 --> 00:00:19,259
Approve the sheet, or return it for
correction with a reason.

6
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:24,196
In Reports, select the month and enable
Approved time only.

7
00:00:24,433 --> 00:00:28,356
Download CSV, PDF or ZIP for the approved
hours.

8
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,405
One weekly review. A clear monthly export.
